  "notable_quotes": [
    "Porosity in related zinc-Atz layered materials is limited by efficient packing of pillaring dicarboxylates; some carboxylate-pillared analogues show no gas uptake.",
    "Initial Atz-metal syntheses failed to give highly crystalline MOFs, so oxalic acid was introduced as a co-ligand to obtain the target framework.",
    "Free amine groups protrude into the pores, creating a zig-zag largest channel and amine-functionalized micropores as a deliberate design feature."
  ],
